1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:03,849
You see, my initial approach to Kripke
had the same deficiencies...

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,820
(Sheldon:)...as those that plagued Stu the Cockatoo
when he was new at the zoo.

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,650
(Raj:)Stu the Cockatoo?

4
00:00:10,819 --> 00:00:12,989
(Leonard:)Yes. He's new at the zoo.

5
00:00:13,488 --> 00:00:16,988
(Sheldon:)It's a terrific book. I've distilled its essence
into a simple flow chart...

6
00:00:17,159 --> 00:00:18,829
...that will guide me through the process.

7
00:00:20,203 --> 00:00:22,083
(Howard:)Have you thought about putting him
in a crate...

8
00:00:22,247 --> 00:00:24,207
(Howard:)...while you're out of the apartment?

9
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:27,583
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello, Kripke.
Yeah, Sheldon Cooper here.

10
00:00:27,753 --> 00:00:30,503
(Sheldon(on phone):)It occurred to me you hadn't returned
any of my calls...

11
00:00:30,672 --> 00:00:34,342
...because I hadn't offered any suggestions
for pursuing our friendship.

12
00:00:34,509 --> 00:00:39,259
Yeah, perhaps the two of us
might share a meal together.

13
00:00:39,806 --> 00:00:41,056
Yeah, I see.

14
00:00:41,224 --> 00:00:45,184
(Sheldon(on phone):)Well, then perhaps you'd have time
for a hot beverage?

15
00:00:45,353 --> 00:00:49,063
(Sheldon(on phone):)Popular choices include tea,
coffee, cocoa.

16
00:00:49,316 --> 00:00:51,396
(Sheldon(on phone):)I see. No, no, no, wait.
Don't hang up yet.

17
00:00:51,568 --> 00:00:54,358
But what about a recreational activity?

18
00:00:54,529 --> 00:00:56,699
(Sheldon(on phone):)I bet we share some common interests.

19
00:00:56,865 --> 00:00:59,705
(Sheldon(on phone):)Tell me an interest of yours.

20
00:00:59,868 --> 00:01:04,028
(Sheldon(on phone):)Really? On actual horses?

